<title>UK: Russia's Novorossiisk oil port shut due to wind.</title>
<headline>Russia's Novorossiisk oil port shut due to wind.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's main oil export terminal of Novorossiisk closed on Friday, a shipping agent said.</p>
<p>The Black Sea terminal shut down at 6 a.m. local time due to wind.</p>
<p>The Black Sea ports of Odessa and Tuapse were open but the weather was getting worse at the latter.</p>
<p>Ventspils port on the Baltic Sea was operating normally.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
